# error: parser_section_error_location.grammar:20:10:
#
# A syntax error in the @parser section is reported with its file, line and
# column, and a non-zero exit.
#
# (architecture.md Appendix A: perr.grammar; SPEC §7.1)

@lexer
tokens
    ident
    eof
    err
[a-zA-Z_][a-zA-Z0-9_]*                      → ident
.                                           → err

@parser

top! = pair                                 → 1
pair = IDENT IDENT                          → (pair 1 2)
broken = = IDENT
